<title>USA: Zanart Entertainment changes name.</title>
<headline>Zanart Entertainment changes name.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zanart Entertainment Inc said on Thursday that its name change to Continucare Corp was effective Thursday, Oct 9.</p>
<p>Zanart recently completed the merger of its wholly-owned subsidiary into Continucare Corp. The common stock and warrants will begin trading under the Continucare name on Monday, Oct 21.</p>
</text>
